  "content": "<h1>🔄 默認遊戲模式 🎮</h1><p>這個模組讓你在創建新世界時，可以更改默認的遊戲模式（生存、極限模式、創造、旁觀者）。它不會更改現有世界的遊戲模式！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"quilt\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Alfakynz/Default-Gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fidPolUDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TcmUQHZ5U4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><h2>✨ 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>創建新世界時更改默認遊戲模式</li>\n<li>支援所有遊戲模式：生存、極限模式、創造和旁觀者</li>\n<li>包含設置功能，可配置要設為默認的遊戲模式（需搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>）</li>\n<li>與 <a href=\"https://github.com/Keksuccino/ModernWorldCreation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern World Creation</a> 相容</li>\n</ul><h2>🔄 版本相容性</h2><ul>\n<li>Minecraft &gt;= 1.20</li>\n<li>Fabric &gt;= 0.16.4</li>\n<li>Quilt &gt;= 0.17.3</li>\n</ul><h2>🚀 計劃中的功能</h2><p>目前暫無規劃，但歡迎提出任何你希望加入的功能！</p><h2>📦 模組包</h2><p>歡迎將 Better Slots 包含在模組包中。</p><h2>🌐 正在尋找伺服器？同時支持我！</h2><p>想和朋友一起玩嗎？透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 獲得屬於你的伺服器。</p><p>使用代碼 <strong>WILDLIGHT</strong> 支持我，並可享 75 折優惠。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hvk4z0Vv/banner-3.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode 伺服器\"></a></p>",
